
Winston:

Winston could charm
the rust off a pipe.
His favorite thing
in the world is
finding someone new
to talk at.
He'll be no use to
you in a fight, but
he has a quick mind,
a mouth that never
runs dry, and he can
hold a subject as
long as you'll stand
there.
Charm and a nose for
a deal have talked
him out of every
corner he's been
backed into.
